{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203110","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203110","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1320311001:1":{"text":"あの、ここはレフスキーさんのお家ですか？どうしてこんなに人が集まっているんです？","source_cn":"大婶，请问这里是列夫斯基的家吗？为什么会聚集这么多人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x893774044722755E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320311002:1":{"text":"ええ、ここがそうよ。集まっている人たちはね……みんな借金の取り立て人よ……","source_cn":"没找错，这就是列夫斯基他们家。至于这些人……唉，都是来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF27E6850EEE4B1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320311003:1":{"text":"え？レフスキーさんは画家なんですよね？どうしてそんなに借金を……？","source_cn":"列夫斯基不是位画家吗，怎么会欠这么多债？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55915918623DAF53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320311004:1":{"text":"それは、彼が病気になってしまったからよ……","source_cn":"还能为什么，都是因为他的病！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01BA045DEA25DF1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320311005:1":{"text":"絵の才能があって、将来を期待されてた子なのに、突然重い病にかかってねえ……","source_cn":"那孩子画画很有天赋，本来前途一片光明，谁能想到会突然得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD62E95988B6DA1F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320311006:1":{"text":"治療のために、父親のエフゲルニアが知り合いや商人、銀行家からお金を借りたのよ。でも結局レフスキーの容態は悪くなるばかりで……","source_cn":"为了给他治病，他父亲叶甫根尼借遍了左邻右舍，又跑去向商...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x564E1347569E3B2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320311007:1":{"text":"かなりの金額を借りたはずだから、返済にどれぐらいかかるか……","source_cn":"唉，欠了那么多钱，哪是一时半会就能还上的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CC75D8B93C547AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320311008:1":{"text":"デューラ様……彼らが一日も早く苦しみから解放されますように……","source_cn":"艾雅在上，但愿列夫斯基一家能早日走出阴霾……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A77FEA4C8543FF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:围观的女人":{"text":"見物人の女","source":"围观的女人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}